Error [E1102]: `task_fixed` cannot be shared into a task — it is a view that does not live long enough
  --> tests/ui/fixed_backing_crossing.jet:7:20
    |
  7 |     worker :: task {
    |                    ^
 Why: a view is a borrow, not an owned value; tasks and channels move owned values between threads
 Fix: give the task plain owned data, or rebuild the value as an owned copy before spawning
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1102

Error [E1102]: `parallel_fixed` cannot cross a parallel worker boundary — it is a view that does not live long enough
  --> tests/ui/fixed_backing_crossing.jet:13:26
    |
 13 |     _ :: values.para_map((n: Int) -> {
    |                          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: a view is a borrow, not an owned value; this concurrent boundary moves owned values between workers
 Fix: copy plain owned data into the worker, or keep this operation sequential
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1102
